<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFrameworks>netstandard2.1</TargetFrameworks>
    <AssemblyVersion>4.5.3.8</AssemblyVersion>
    <FileVersion>4.5.3.8</FileVersion>
    <Version>4.5.3.8-ora.5</Version>
    <GeneratePackageOnBuild>false</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
	<PackageIcon>icon.jpg</PackageIcon>
    <PackageLicenseUrl></PackageLicenseUrl>
    <PackageId>OraBooster.EPPlus</PackageId>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/orascope/orabooster-epplus</PackageProjectUrl>
	  <Authors>OraScope Co.,Ltd. (fork); Rimland (EPPlusFree); Jan Källman and EPPlus Software AB (EPPlus)</Authors>
    <Company></Company>
    <Product>EPPlus Free Edition</Product>
	<Title>EPPlus 4.5 (LGPL) for OraBooster</Title>
    <Description>A fork of EPPlusFree 4.5.3.8 (itself a continuation of EPPlus 4.5.3.3, LGPL) used by OraBooster, with a faster save path. Not an official EPPlus release.</Description>
    <AssemblyName>OraBooster.EPPlus</AssemblyName>
    <RootNamespace>EPPlus</RootNamespace>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/orascope/orabooster-epplus</RepositoryUrl>
    <PackageTags>EPPlus Excel Spreadsheet xlsx ooxml</PackageTags>
    <Copyright>Copyright (C) 2011-2020 Jan Källman, EPPlus Software AB, Rimland; fork changes 2026 OraScope Co.,Ltd.</Copyright>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>
		4.5.3.8-ora.5
		- The export of a range: ToDataTable, ToText and SaveToText (delimited text, the reverse of LoadFromText), ToJson, ToHtml (issue #32).
		- An encrypted workbook is loaded again on .NET 6 and later (issue #35).

		4.5.3.8-ora.4
		- A chart series added with no X range (null or "") no longer throws or writes a reference with no address (issue #27).
		- A loaded XYScatter chart has its chart type (it was XYScatterLinesNoMarkers), so a series added to it has markers and no line (issue #29).

		4.5.3.8-ora.3
		- Ignored errors of a worksheet: ExcelWorksheet.IgnoredErrors (issue #9).
		- Stock charts with volume: StockVHLC and StockVOHLC (issue #11).
		- AutoFitColumns is 3 to 7 times faster, with the same widths (issue #14).
		- Filters and sort of an autofilter: ExcelWorksheet.AutoFilter, ExcelTable.AutoFilter (issue #17).
		- Chart series: fill and border are valid on every chart type and in the order of the schema, data points, error bars (issue #19).
		- The chart types of Excel 2016: waterfall, treemap, sunburst, histogram, Pareto, box and whisker, funnel (issue #21).
		- FormulaR1C1 no longer writes the minus sign of the culture (sv-SE, nb-NO, fi-FI on .NET 5 and later) (issue #23).
		- A loaded chart has each chart type once in PlotArea.ChartTypes; series added to a chart with several chart types get numbers that are free (issue #12).
		- A number that is not a date in a date format shows as # signs and no longer stops AutoFitColumns (issue #15).
		4.5.3.8-ora.2
		- Deleting a table no longer leaves the next table id at 0 or at an id in use (issue #2).
		- Column3D, StockHLC and StockOHLC charts; the volume stock charts throw NotSupportedException before anything is added (issue #3).
		- Cell addresses are built without extra strings (issue #4). Loading uses System.IO.Compression (issue #5).
		- EPPlusTest runs on .NET 10 (issue #6).
		4.5.3.8-ora.1 (orabooster-epplus, a fork of EPPlusFree 4.5.3.8 by OraScope Co.,Ltd.)
		- Saves the package with System.IO.Compression (native zlib) instead of the managed DotNetZip deflater.
		- Fewer allocations when worksheet cells are written. TypeCompat.IsPrimitive without reflection.
		- AutoFitColumns disposes its GDI+ objects.
		- Targets netstandard2.1 only. Not strong-name signed. System.Drawing.Common 4.7.2.
		The saved parts are byte-for-byte the same as EPPlusFree 4.5.3.8; only the zip compression differs.
		Origin: https://github.com/JanKallman/EPPlus (EPPlus 4.5.3.3, LGPL) -> https://github.com/rimland/EPPlus (EPPlusFree 4.5.3.8) -> this fork.
	</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <SignAssembly>false</SignAssembly>
    <AssemblyOriginatorKeyFile>OpenOfficeXml.Rimland.snk</AssemblyOriginatorKeyFile>
    <NeutralLanguage />
    <PackageLicenseFile>lgpl-3.0.txt</PackageLicenseFile>
  </PropertyGroup>
 
  <PropertyGroup Condition=" '$(TargetFramework)' == 'netstandard2.0'">
    <DefineConstants>Core;STANDARD20</DefineConstants>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup Condition=" '$(TargetFramework)' == 'netstandard2.1'">
    <DefineConstants>Core</DefineConstants>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup Condition=" '$(TargetFramework)' == 'net35'">
    <DefineConstants>NET35;NETFULL</DefineConstants>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup Condition=" '$(TargetFramework)' == 'net40'">
    <DefineConstants>NET40;NETFULL</DefineConstants>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(Platform)'=='AnyCPU'">
    <DocumentationFile>bin\$(Configuration)\$(TargetFramework)\OraBooster.EPPlus.xml</DocumentationFile>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(Configuration)|$(TargetFramework)|$(Platform)'=='Debug|netstandard2.0|AnyCPU'">
    <NoWarn>1591</NoWarn>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <Compile Remove="Packaging\DotNetZip\ZipFile.SaveSelfExtractor.cs" />
  </ItemGroup>


  <ItemGroup Condition=" '$(TargetFramework)' == 'net35'">
    <Reference Include="PresentationCore" />
    <Reference Include="PresentationFramework" />
    <Reference Include="System" />
    <Reference Include="System.configuration" />
    <Reference Include="System.Core" />
    <Reference Include="System.Data" />
    <Reference Include="System.Drawing" />
    <Reference Include="System.Security" />
    <Reference Include="System.Xml" />
    <Reference Include="WindowsBase" />
  </ItemGroup>
  
  <ItemGroup Condition=" '$(TargetFramework)' == 'net40'">
    <Reference Include="PresentationCore" />
    <Reference Include="System" />
    <Reference Include="System.configuration" />
    <Reference Include="System.Core" />
    <Reference Include="System.Data" />
    <Reference Include="System.Drawing" />
    <Reference Include="System.Security" />
    <Reference Include="System.Xml" />
  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup Condition="'$(TargetFramework)' == 'netstandard2.0'">
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.Configuration.Json" Version="3.1.0" />
    <PackageReference Include="System.ComponentModel.TypeConverter" Version="4.3.0" />
    <PackageReference Include="System.Data.Common" Version="4.3.0" />
    <PackageReference Include="System.Drawing.Common">
      <Version>4.7.2</Version>
    </PackageReference>
    <PackageReference Include="System.Reflection" Version="4.3.0" />
    <PackageReference Include="System.Security.Claims" Version="4.3.0" />
    <PackageReference Include="System.Security.Cryptography.Pkcs" Version="4.7.0" />
    <PackageReference Include="System.Security.Cryptography.X509Certificates" Version="4.3.2" />
    <PackageReference Include="System.Text.Encoding.CodePages" Version="4.7.0" />
    <PackageReference Include="System.Xml.XmlDocument" Version="4.3.0" />
    <PackageReference Include="System.Xml.XPath.XmlDocument" Version="4.3.0" />
  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup Condition="'$(TargetFramework)' == 'netstandard2.1'">
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.Configuration.Json" Version="3.1.0" />
    <PackageReference Include="System.ComponentModel.TypeConverter" Version="4.3.0" />
    <PackageReference Include="System.Data.Common" Version="4.3.0" />
    <PackageReference Include="System.Drawing.Common">
      <Version>4.7.2</Version>
    </PackageReference>
    <PackageReference Include="System.Reflection" Version="4.3.0" />
    <PackageReference Include="System.Security.Claims" Version="4.3.0" />
    <PackageReference Include="System.Security.Cryptography.Pkcs" Version="4.7.0" />
    <PackageReference Include="System.Security.Cryptography.X509Certificates" Version="4.3.2" />
    <PackageReference Include="System.Text.Encoding.CodePages" Version="4.7.0" />
    <PackageReference Include="System.Xml.XmlDocument" Version="4.3.0" />
    <PackageReference Include="System.Xml.XPath.XmlDocument" Version="4.3.0" />
  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <None Update="readme.txt">
      <CopyToOutputDirectory>PreserveNewest</CopyToOutputDirectory>
    </None>
    <None Include="lgpl-3.0.txt">
      <Pack>True</Pack>
      <PackagePath></PackagePath>
    </None>
	<None Include="icon.jpg" Pack="true" Visible="false" PackagePath="" />
  </ItemGroup>
</Project>